From 9ed59f888d2693ae6646cf72426a0d650ce382a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FreeholdOS Build <build@freeholdos.local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:42:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compartments: withhold the position of a blocked app at
 delivery, persona properties, review fixes

An app whose location is blocked, or substituted without a persona, is delivered no
fix and no GNSS data, whatever permission it holds (the service keeps the set of
withheld app ids with the persona table). A persona fix loses its extras and a fix
without a finite position is put at the place. The network operator and time zone
properties are answered from the persona in SystemProperties.get. The SDK sandbox
of an app follows the app. Places with a time zone the image does not know are left
out. A stale gap resets the activity estimator. The passive fix listener is
registered again after a failure. The place and cell data are read on the handler
thread. The store limit is the size of the largest legal store. A new method
getPersonaPlaceId returns the place a persona has now.
